      "previewText": "Thorium, a rare element in the earth's crust, has over seven radioactive isotopes. One of these, , has a half-life of 18.68 days. Calculate the decay constant. d−1What percent of Th-227 will be left after @@days@@ days? %When @@percent@@ % is left, how much time has passed? days",
